# The worktree is normalised to LF regardless of core.autocrlf. config.test.ts
# reads docker-compose.yml as text and matches whole lines; a checkout that
# appends carriage returns makes those matches fail on one platform only. The
# schema and template files are read through JSON.parse, which does not care.
#
# The index was renormalised when this was added -- thirteen paths were still
# stored CRLF -- so the attribute does not turn the next edit of one of them
# into a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
